# NOTICE

superred-claim-hackaprompt

This module is a port of HackAPrompt into the superred red-teaming framework.
Original code in this module (the superred adaptation: the pure judge, task model,
factories, and tests) is licensed MIT (see LICENSE). It reproduces the win-
condition evaluation from HackAPrompt; the upstream MIT license text is preserved
in `LICENSES/HackAPrompt-MIT.txt`.

## Upstream: HackAPrompt

